  "body": "Why wait for a holiday when you can enjoy a relaxed resort-style lifestyle every day?\r\n\r\nNestled within the highly sought-after Gulf Harbour community, 105 Pinecrest Drive is part of the tightly held Fairway Bay area, offering an appealing blend of relaxed coastal living, modern design and lock-up-and-leave convenience. Beautifully presented, this single-level home is designed for easy, low-maintenance living.\r\n\r\nThe Highlights:\r\n\r\n• Prime Corner Position: Enjoy excellent sun, established greenery and an enhanced sense of space and privacy.\r\n\r\n• Seamless Indoor-Outdoor Living: The sleek designer kitchen sits at the heart of the home, flowing through open-plan living to the landscaped gardens and sun-soaked BBQ terrace.\r\n\r\n• Smart Family Layout: Four double bedrooms, including a spacious master retreat with a walk-in wardrobe and private ensuite.\r\n\r\n• Exclusive Resort Amenities: Residents enjoy private access to the swimming pool, tennis court and clubhouse, all just a short stroll away and included through the Fairway Bay society fee.\r\n\r\n• The Location: Positioned in the premium Hobbs Bay enclave, close to coastal walkways, beaches, playgrounds and the Gulf Harbour marina lifestyle. Zoned for Gulf Harbour School and Whangaparaoa College, with Wentworth Primary and College nearby, plus future Penlink connectivity.\r\n\r\n• Peace of Mind: Complete with the balance of the Master Builders Guarantee for added confidence (subject to Master Build approval).\r\n\r\nRelocating vendors are committed to their next chapter and motivated to achieve a sale. Tightly held properties in this sought-after pocket are rarely available. This is an opportunity to secure the Gulf Harbour lifestyle.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
